---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const ageYears = new Date().getFullYear() - 2003;
---

<Layout
    title='about | matheus teixeira'
    description='a little about me, how i got here and what my tastes are.'
>
    <section class='space-y-2 max-w-125 text-justify'>
        <p>so...</p>
        <p>
            i'm a {ageYears} years old brazilian systems programmer. i'm a
            bachelor in computer science, i love solving problems and i care
            about code optimizations on projects i that work on.
        </p>
        <p>
            i'm a passionate gamer, and i love smw hacking — so much so that i'm
            learning smw assembly and tinkering with it.
        </p>
        <p>
            i'm a linux advocate since 2019 and never looked back. my current os
            is fedora. i have some love for macs as well, and so much nostalgia
            from windows xp and windows 7.
        </p>
        <p>
            and the languages i like for programming are many... but mostly rust
            and golang.
        </p>
        <p>
            my site uses catppuccin's{' '}
            <a href='https://catppuccin.com/palette/#flavor-mocha'>
                mocha theme
            </a>
            .
        </p>
    </section>
</Layout>
